id: pm-release-devtool-patches
title: Refresh eligible Node type and Greptile release-review tooling patches
description: "Registry-current @types/node 26.6.4 and greptile 3.6.1 are compatible patch upgrades older than seven days. Upgrade these review/release development tools while preserving runtime dependencies, the declared Node floor, strict peer compatibility and the seven-day admission rule. Newer eslint/typescript-eslint/knip/marked releases remain below cooldown; Vitest 5, TypeScript 7 and npm-package-arg 14 retain their existing canonical migration owners."
