resolution: "Updated @types/node to 26.6.4 and Greptile to 3.6.1 after seven-day registry publication eligibility, preserving runtime dependencies, declared runtime floor and strict peers. Existing major migration owners and fresh below-cooldown versions remain explicitly linked."
